hifiberry-analog-recognition (0.2.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the ACR player definition as /etc/audiocontrol/players.d/analog.json.
    The file defines the "generic" analog player, matching the file already
    deployed in the field. It used to be generated at install time by
    postinst; now it ships as a packaged conffile via debian/rules.

